    "heading": "Level 3: Monk Subclass",
    "lineStart": 3251,
    "lineEnd": 3253
  },
  "section": "3.141",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Monk subclass of your choice. The Warrior of the Open Hand subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Monk levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Monk level or lower."
}
